verse/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L302-L315","doc":"**`dim (image of the Jimbo action) = catalan (m+1)`** over any `CharZero` field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.tlRep_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.tlRep_injective","kind":"theorem","line":289,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L289-L300","doc":"**The Temperley–Lieb representation on `V^{⊗(m+1)}` is faithful.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_wtrace_generic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_wtrace_generic","kind":"theorem","line":281,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L281-L287","doc":"Pointwise form: `ρ(x) = 0 ↔ x ∈ rad(wtrace)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.ker_jimbo_eq_traceRadicalIdeal_generic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.ker_jimbo_eq_traceRadicalIdeal_generic","kind":"theorem","line":267,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L267-L279","doc":"**`ker(jimbo) = rad(wtrace)`** as two-sided ideals, over any `CharZero` field, for\n`q ≠ 0` not a root of unity.  Removes the ordered-field hypothesis of\n`JimboActionKernel.ker_jimbo_eq_traceRadicalIdeal`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.jimbo_eq_comp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.jimbo_eq_comp","kind":"theorem","line":256,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L256-L265","doc":"**The Jimbo action factors through the Temperley–Lieb algebra**:\n`jimbo = tlRep ∘ heckeToTLGeneric`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.heckeToTLGeneric_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.heckeToTLGeneric_σ","kind":"theorem","line":250,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L250-L254","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.heckeToTLGeneric","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.heckeToTLGeneric","kind":"def","line":244,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L244-L248","doc":"The composite `H → H/rad ≃ TL`: the Temperley–Lieb quotient map `σ_i ↦ q − e_i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.traceQuotTLEquiv_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.traceQuotTLEquiv_σ","kind":"theorem","line":234,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L234-L242","doc":"The isomorphism `H/rad ≃ TL` sends the class of `σ_i` to `q − e_i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.traceQuotTLEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.traceQuotTLEquiv","kind":"def","line":228,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L228-L232","doc":"**`H_{m+1}(q)/rad(wtrace) ≃ₐ[K] TL_{m+1}(q + q⁻¹)`** (`H/rad ≅ TL`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.tlTraceQuotEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.tlTraceQuotEquiv","kind":"def","line":220,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L220-L226","doc":"**`TL_{m+1}(q + q⁻¹) ≃ₐ[K] H_{m+1}(q)/rad(wtrace)`**, `e_i ↦ π(q − σ_i)`, over any\n`CharZero` field, `q ≠ 0` not a root of unity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.tlToQuot_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.tlToQuot_injective","kind":"theorem","line":209,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L209-L218","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.finrank_tl_eq_catalan_generic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.finrank_tl_eq_catalan_generic","kind":"theorem","line":197,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L197-L207","doc":"**`dim TL_{m+1}(q + q⁻¹) = catalan (m+1)`** over any `CharZero` field, `q ≠ 0` not a root\nof unity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.finrank_quot_eq_catalan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.finrank_quot_eq_catalan","kind":"theorem","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboKernelGeneric.lean#L193-L195","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.tlToQuot_surjective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboKernelGeneric.tlToQuot_surjective","kind":"theorem","line":187,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5